.Sh CAVEATS
.Nm
needs NVC built with Tcl support and carrying the patches in the source
distribution's
.Pa contrib
directory, until an NVC release includes them.
.Pp
.Nm
depends on the Verilator package its releases carry (the source
distribution's
.Pa contrib/verilator ) :
a recent release, with fixes not yet upstream.
.Pp
.Nm
is not affiliated with NVC.
